@startuml uc_007_guidance
!include common/uc_styles.puml

title **UC-007 — Guidance & Analytics**\n(Bounded Context: Guidance & Analytics)

left to right direction

actor "Regulatory\nOfficial" as RO #E3F2FD
actor "Compliance\nRepresentative" as CR #E8EAF6

rectangle "Selma Application" as SYS {
  rectangle "Guidance & Analytics\n(findings)" as BOUNDED {

    usecase "Resolve Guidance"              as UC1
    usecase "View Finding Aggregates"       as UC2
    usecase "View Trend Analysis"           as UC3
    usecase "View Compliance Dashboard"     as UC4
    usecase "Explain Finding\nCausally"     as UC5
  }
}

' ---- associations ----
RO --> UC1
RO --> UC2
RO --> UC3
RO --> UC4
RO --> UC5

CR --> UC1
CR --> UC2
CR --> UC3
CR --> UC4
CR --> UC5

UC5 ..> UC2 : <<include>>

' ---- notes ----
note right of UC1
  **Pre:** Finding context available
  **Post:** Applicable guidance rule resolved;
  recommendation surfaced to actor
end note

note right of UC5
  **Pre:** Finding selected; causal chain data present
  **Post:** Human-readable causal explanation
  produced linking finding to root directive/control
end note

note bottom of UC4
  **Pre:** Actor authenticated with dashboard capability
  **Post:** Aggregated compliance posture rendered
end note

@enduml
